        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/about-the-bc-provincial-nominee-program/invitations-to-apply" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Invitations to Apply (November 13, 2026 round and November 3, 2026 pool data), WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/about-the-bc-provincial-nominee-program/news" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">BC PNP receives additional allocation for 2026 (August 18, 2026), WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/skills-immigration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Skills Immigration for workers, WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.welcomebc.ca/immigrate-to-b-c/bc-pnp-si-program-guide-pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Skills Immigration Program Guide, WelcomeBC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/2026/11/minister-metlege-diab-highlights-how-canada-is-working-with-provinces-and-territories-to-support-worker-retention.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Working with provinces and territories to support worker retention (November 12, 2026), IRCC</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/corporate/mandate/policies-operational-instructions-agreements/ministerial-instructions/express-entry-rounds.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Rounds of invitations, Express Entry, IRCC</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4">Information current as of November 14, 2026. Draw results and program rules change often; confirm on WelcomeBC before applying.</p>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Related Articles</h2>
      <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/articles/bc-pnp-early-childhood-educators-2027" class="block bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="text-sm text-red-600 font-bold mb-2">Childcare</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-gray-900">BC PNP for Early Childhood Educators</div>
        </a>
        <a href="/articles/bc-pnp-care-healthcare-occupations-list-2027" class="block bg-white border border-slate-200 p-6 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
